{"ref":"BDB, עֵין־דֹּר","hw":"עֵין־דֹּר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֵין־דֹּר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> in Manasseh <a data-ref=\"Joshua 17:11\" href=\"/Joshua.17.11\">Jos 17:11</a> (JE; om. 𝔊), = <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ דּוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.7\">1 S 28:7</a> (Αελδωρ, 𝔊L Αενδωρ), <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳־דֹּאר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:11\" href=\"/Psalms.83.11\">ψ 83:11</a> (Gr <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ חֲרוֹד</span>), Αενδωρ; <em>Endûr</em>, c. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:14\" href=\"/Psalms.83.14\">14</a> miles NNE. from foregoing.","next":"BDB, עֵין חַדָּה","prev":"BDB, עֵין גַּנִּים"}